{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-psa-50-1","title":"Psalms 50:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":50,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":50,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 The majesty of God in the church. 5 His order to gather his saints. 7 The pleasure of God is not in ceremonies, 14 but in sincerity of obedience.</p>\n<p>(Title.) of Asaph. or, for Asaph. 73:1; 83:1; *titles 1Ch 15:17; 16:37; 25:2,6; 2Ch 29:30 mighty. 145:3-6; Ge 17:1; Jos 22:22; Ne 9:6,32; Isa 9:6; Jer 10:6; 32:18,19 even. 1Ki 18:21,36,37; Isa 37:20; 54:5 hath spoken. Isa 1:2; Am 3:8 called. 49:1,2; 113:3; Mal 1:11; Mt 25:32</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-50-2","title":"Psalms 50:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":50,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":50,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>Out. 68:24; Isa 12:6; 26:21; Ho 5:15; Hab 2:20; Heb 12:22-26 perfection. 48:2; 87:2,3; 80:17; So 5:16; Zec 9:17 God. 80:1; De 33:2; Hab 3:3,4; Re 1:16; 21:23</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-50-3","title":"Psalms 50:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":50,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":50,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>Our. 48:14; 68:20; Re 22:20 keep. 21; 83:1; Isa 42:13,14; 65:6,7 a fire. 97:3; Ex 19:18; Le 10:2; Nu 16:35; De 9:3; 1Ki 19:11,12; Da 7:10 Na 1:5-7; Hab 3:5; Mal 3:2,3; 4:1; Mt 3:12; 2Th 1:8,9; Heb 2:3 Heb 10:28,29; 12:18-21,29 it shall. 18:7-15; 97:4,5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-50-4","title":"Psalms 50:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":50,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":50,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>call. 6; De 4:36; 30:19; 31:28; 32:1; Isa 1:2; Mic 6:1,2 judge. 96:13; 98:9; Isa 11:3,4; Joh 5:22,23</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-50-5","title":"Psalms 50:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":50,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":50,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>Gather. Mt 24:31; 1Th 4:16,17; 2Th 2:1 my saints. 97:10; De 33:2,3; Pr 2:8; Isa 13:3; Zec 14:5; 1Co 6:2,3; 1Th 3:13 Jude 1:14 made. Ex 24:3-8; Mt 26:28; Heb 9:10-23; 12:24; 13:20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-50-6","title":"Psalms 50:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":50,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":50,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>heavens. 97:6; Ro 2:5; Re 16:5-7; 19:2 God. 75:7; Ge 18:25; Joh 5:22,23; Ro 14:9-12; 2Co 5:10; Re 20:11,12 Selah. 7:3-5; 9:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-50-7","title":"Psalms 50:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":50,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":50,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>Hear. 81:8; Isa 1:18; Jer 2:4,5,9; Mic 6:1-8 O my. 81:10-12; Ex 19:5,6; De 26:17,18; 1Sa 12:22-25 testify. De 31:19-21; 2Ki 17:13; Ne 9:29,30; Mal 3:5 I am. Ex 20:2; 2Ch 28:5; Eze 20:5,7,19,20; Zec 13:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-50-8","title":"Psalms 50:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":50,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":50,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>40:6-8; 51:16; Isa 1:11-31; Jer 7:21-23; Ho 6:6; Heb 10:4-10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-50-9","title":"Psalms 50:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":50,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":50,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>Isa 43:23,24; Mic 6:6-8; Ac 17:25; Heb 10:4-6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-50-10","title":"Psalms 50:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":50,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":50,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>every. 8:6-8; 104:24,25; Ge 1:24,25; 2:19; 8:17; 9:2,3; 1Ch 29:14-16 Job 40:15-24; Jer 27:5,6; Da 2:38 cattle. 104:14; Ge 31:9; Jon 4:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-50-11","title":"Psalms 50:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":50,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":50,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>know. 104:12; 147:9; Ge 1:20-22; Job 38:41; 39:13-18,26-30; Mt 6:26 Mt 10:29-31; Lu 12:24 wild. Isa 56:9; Eze 14:15,16 mine. Heb. with me.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-50-12","title":"Psalms 50:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":50,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":50,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>world. 24:1,2; 115:15,16; Ex 19:5; De 10:14; Job 41:11; 1Co 10:26-28 fulness. 104:24; 145:15,16; Ge 1:11,12,28-30; 8:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-50-14","title":"Psalms 50:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":50,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":50,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>Offer. 23; 69:30,31; 107:21,22; 147:1; Ho 14:2; 1Th 5:18; Heb 13:15 1Pe 2:5,9 pay. 56:12; 76:11; 116:12-14,17,18; Le 27:2-34; Nu 30:2-16; De 23:21 Ec 5:4,5; Na 1:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-50-15","title":"Psalms 50:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":50,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":50,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>call. 77:2; 91:15; 107:6-13,19,28; 2Ch 33:12,13; Job 22:27; Zec 13:9 Lu 22:44; Ac 16:25; Jas 5:13 deliver. 34:3,4; 66:13-20; Lu 17:15-18 glorify. 23; 22:23; Mt 5:16; Joh 15:8; 1Pe 4:11,14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-50-16","title":"Psalms 50:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":50,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":50,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>wicked. Isa 48:22; 55:6,7; Eze 18:27 What. Pr 26:7; Isa 1:11-15; 48:1,2; 58:1-7; Jer 7:4-7; Mt 7:3-5,22,23 Joh 4:24; Ac 19:13-16; Ro 2:17-24; 1Co 9:27; 2Pe 2:15 thou shouldest. 25:14; 78:36-38; Eze 20:37,38; Heb 8:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-50-17","title":"Psalms 50:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":50,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":50,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>hatest. Pr 1:7,28,29; 5:12,13; 8:36; 12:1; Joh 3:20; Ro 1:28; 2:21,23 2Th 2:10-12; 2Ti 4:3,4 castest. Ne 9:26; Isa 5:23; Jer 8:9; 18:12; 36:23-32</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-50-18","title":"Psalms 50:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":50,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":50,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>consentedst. Pr 1:10-19; Isa 5:23; Mic 7:3; Ro 1:32; Eph 5:11-13 hast been partaker. Heb. thy portion was. Le 20:10; Job 31:9-11; Pr 2:16-19; 7:19-23; Jer 5:8,9; Heb 13:4 partaker. Mt 23:30; 1Ti 5:22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-50-19","title":"Psalms 50:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":50,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":50,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>givest. Heb. sendest. 52:3-4; Jer 9:5 tongue. 5:9; 10:7; 12:2,3; 36:3,4; 55:12,21; 64:3-5; Isa 59:3,4; Ho 4:2 Ro 3:13,14; Jas 3:5-9; Re 21:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-50-20","title":"Psalms 50:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":50,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":50,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>speakest. 31:18; Mt 5:11; Lu 22:65 slanderest. Le 19:16; Pr 10:18; 1Ti 3:11; Tit 2:3; Re 12:10 thine own. Mt 10:21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-50-21","title":"Psalms 50:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":50,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":50,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>I kept. 3; 109:1-3; Ec 8:11,12; Isa 26:10; 57:11; Ro 2:4,5; 2Pe 3:9 thoughtest. 73:11; 94:7-11; Nu 23:19; Isa 40:15-18 that I was altogether such an one as thyself.Or, as Bishop Horsley renders, \"that I AM [{Eheyeh}] is such an one as thyself.\"</p>\n<p>Ex 3:14 will. 8; Pr 29:1; Re 3:19 set. 90:8; Ec 12:14; Am 8:7; 1Co 4:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-50-22","title":"Psalms 50:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":50,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":50,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>consider. De 32:18; Ec 7:14; Eze 18:28; Hag 1:5; Lu 15:17 forget. 9:17; 10:4; Job 8:13; Isa 51:13; Jer 2:32; Ho 4:6 I tear. Ho 5:14; 13:8; Re 6:16,17 none. 7:2; 2Sa 22:42; Am 2:14; Mic 5:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-50-23","title":"Psalms 50:23","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":50,"verseStart":23,"chapterEnd":50,"verseEnd":23},"content":"<p>Whoso. 14,15; 22:23; 27:6; 86:9,12; Ro 12:1; 15:6,9; Ga 1:24; 1Pe 2:9 to him. 24:4,5; 25:14; 85:9; Joh 7:17; 8:31,32; Ac 10:2-4; 11:14; 13:26 Ga 6:16 ordereth his conversation. Heb. disposeth his way. Php 1:27; Jas 3:13; 1Pe 1:15 salvation. 91:16; Isa 12:2; 45:17; 49:6; 51:5,6; Lu 2:30</p>"}]}